  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CottonMC/Vivatech/master/docs/fabric_badge.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"77\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric 服务端</strong>模组。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">允许你打开并操作在线和离线玩家的物品栏与末影箱。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">仅需安装于服务器端！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;*   <span style=\"font-size:14px\">支持饰品栏（Trinkets）</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">支持 LuckPerms</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>物品栏</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/elpDEle.gif\" alt=\"操作物品栏演示\" width=\"524\" height=\"230\"></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>末影箱</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dqVrUmX.gif\" alt=\"操作末影箱演示\" width=\"524\" height=\"210\"></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>离线玩家</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dhQ7czc.gif\" alt=\"操作离线玩家演示\" width=\"524\" height=\"189\"></span></p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">命令</span></strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">/view (inv<strong>|</strong>echest) &lt;玩家名称&gt;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（需要 OP 权限）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>权限节点</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">invview.command.root - 允许玩家使用 /view 命令</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">invview.command.inv- 允许玩家使用 /view inv 命令</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">invview.command.echest- 允许玩家使用 /view echest 命令</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">invview.command.trinket- 允许玩家使用 /view trinket 命令</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">invview.protected- 保护玩家的物品栏不被他人打开</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">invview.can_modify- 阻止玩家编辑查看到的物品栏（默认为 true）</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
